        "code": 2,
        "name": "House floor actions"
      },
      "text": "At the conclusion of debate, the chair put the question on the motion to suspend the rules. Mr. Green (TN) objected to the vote on the grounds that a quorum was not present. Further proceedings on the motion were postponed. The point of no quorum was considered as withdrawn.",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
